{"metadata":{"role":"article","modules":[{"name":"Swami"}],"title":"Origami → SwiftUI reference","roleHeading":"Article"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Origami’s patch graph and SwiftUI both describe how values flow and change over","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"time, so the translations map onto SwiftUI’s own tools: computed properties for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"pure math, gestures and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@State"},{"text":" for interaction, ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"withAnimation"},{"text":" for motion. Most","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"patches land on a native SwiftUI construct. A few need a helper from the ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"library, named after the patch it stands in for.","type":"text"}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Patch-%E2%86%92-SwiftUI","text":"Patch → SwiftUI"},{"type":"table","rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Origami patch"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"SwiftUI"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Pure value patch (Add, interpolate, logic)","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"computed property \/ expression (native)","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Interaction (Tap, Press, Double Tap, Long Press)"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"gesture + "},{"code":"@State","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" via "},{"code":"View\/interaction(down:position:onTap:onDoubleTap:onLongPress:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (hel