,"anchor":"How-the-categories-map"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Pure value patches","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" — ","type":"text"},{"code":"Add","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", interpolation, logic — carry no state. They run an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"input through math and emit a result, which is exactly a computed property or an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"inline expression.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Interaction"}]},{"text":" exposes discrete outputs: ","type":"text"},{"code":"down","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"position","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"onTap","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"onDoubleTap","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"onLongPress","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". Each becomes a SwiftUI gesture whose result lands in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"@State","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" or fires a callback. The ","type":"text"},{"code":".interaction(…)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" modifier attaches only the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"recognizers you ask for, so gesture arbitration stays clean.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"State and memory","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" — "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Switch"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sample and Hold"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Pop Switch"},{"type":"text","text":" — remember a value"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"between evaluations. That is what "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@State"},{"type":"text","text":" is for; the update path is a gesture"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"tex